  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 智能体应用浪潮与地缘政局动荡并存 / Global AI Agent Wave Coexists with Geopolitical Instability",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI 智能体（Agent）的实际应用与落地研究，Anthropic 的动态工作流与工业机器人实践展示了 AI 从理论走向产业执行的确定性潜力。财经领域，新加坡银行业绩波动引发市场对区域避险地位的担忧，欧洲汽车政策调整与奢侈品需求放缓映射出全球制造业与消费端的深度转型。政局方面，波兰挫败俄罗斯背景的破坏活动，乌克兰能源设施持续遇袭，阿尔伯塔省分离公投在即，地缘政治的持续撕裂正深刻影响大宗商品供应与区域安全格局。\n\nToday's tech focus shifts to the practical implementation of AI Agents, with Anthropic’s dynamic workflows and industrial robotics illustrating a transition from theory to industrial execution. In finance, Singapore's banking sell-off raises concerns about its safe-haven status, while European automotive policy shifts and luxury demand slumps highlight global structural transitions. Geopolitically, Poland’s thwarted sabotage attempt, persistent strikes on Ukrainian energy infrastructure, and Alberta’s upcoming secession referendum underscore how ongoing instability continues to disrupt commodity supplies and regional security.",
